# Build context is the REPO ROOT (see vision/Dockerfile).
# Everything here is uploaded to the builder before anything runs, so keep the
# heavy local-only directories out of it.
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.venv/
**/.toolchain/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
*.pyc

apps/
packages/
scripts/
docs/
samples/
vision/tests/
vision/pytest.ini

.git/
.github/
*.md
